<title>SWEDEN: TENNIS-DAVIS CUP ENDS IN WIN FOR FRANCE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-DAVIS CUP ENDS IN WIN FOR FRANCE.</headline>
<dateline>MALMO, Sweden 1996-12-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the deciding</p>
<p>second reverse singles in the Davis Cup tennis final between</p>
<p>Sweden and France on Sunday:</p>
<p>Arnaud Boetsch (France) beat Nicklas Kulti (Sweden) 7-6 2-6 4-6</p>
<p>7-6 10-8</p>
<p>Earlier result: Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) beat Cedric Pioline</p>
<p>(France) 3-6 6-7 (8-10) 6-4 6-4 9-7</p>
<p>France win 3-2.</p>
</text>
